WEBVTT

00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:31.480
It's a big deal to put wind
turbines out in the ocean.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.947
The ocean, the winds are much stronger,

00:07:33.947 --> 00:07:36.583
and the winds are much more
constant, not only stronger.

00:07:36.583 --> 00:07:38.317
So it balances the grid beautifully.

00:07:38.317 --> 00:07:40.897
But it's really hard to build things
in the deep ocean.

00:07:40.897 --> 00:07:41.867
Norway's good at it.

00:07:41.867 --> 00:07:43.233
So let them take that on.

00:07:43.233 --> 00:07:44.501
JD: Are they taking it on?

00:07:44.501 --> 00:07:45.591
HH: They are actually.

00:07:45.591 --> 00:07:46.979
Yeah. It's pretty brilliant.

00:07:46.979 --> 00:07:48.627
Another example: India.

00:07:48.627 --> 00:07:50.937
There are hundreds of millions
of people in India

00:07:50.937 --> 00:07:52.747
that don’t have access to electricity.

00:07:52.747 --> 00:07:55.237
With the advances in solar
and advances in batteries,

00:07:55.237 --> 00:07:57.340
there's no reason
they have to build the grid

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.450
to all those villages
that don't have a grid.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.521
Skip the steps.